<title>INDIA: India ITC Agro jumps on ConAgra news.</title>
<headline>India ITC Agro jumps on ConAgra news.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in India's ITC Agro-Tech Ltd rose ten percent, to 80.0 rupees at the Bombay exchange in early Tuesday trade on reports that U.S. food giant ConAgra Inc will acquire 51.29 percent in the firm, traders said.</p>
</text>
